<Slide notes={`现在说那个最常见的错误：把题集的平均准确率直接当成 p 代进公式。

假设题集里一半的题始终成功，另一半始终失败，整体平均是百分之五十。有人看到这个五成，就套公式说重复两次以后，至少一次成功应该是七成五，两次全部成功应该是两成五。

这是错的。始终成功的那一半题两次都成功，始终失败的题两次都失败，所以重复两次之后两个比例仍然都是五成。

原因在于题目难度不一样，它们不是同一枚硬币，必须先逐题计算再按规定汇总。

研究里常见的做法是每题采样 n 次、观察其中成功了 c 次，再用组合数估计。要记住：组合数里 a 小于 k 时取零；无偏估计的前提是独立同分布采样，k 大于一时把 c 除以 n 直接代入幂公式并不无偏。`} style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column', padding: '20px 64px' }}>

    <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 44, background: '#276FBF' }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>1.3.4　多给几次机会，与每次都可靠</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>不能把题集平均当作 p</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 32 }}>

        <Box style={{ width: 670, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>一半题始终成功，一半始终失败</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#546779' }}>十道题里五道每次都做对，五道每次都做错，总平均 50%。</Text>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', height: 60, gap: 6 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 58, height: 60, background: '#26816B', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#FFFFFF' }}>1</Text></Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 58, height: 60, background: '#26816B', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#FFFFFF' }}>2</Text></Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 58, height: 60, background: '#26816B', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#FFFFFF' }}>3</Text></Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 58, height: 60, background: '#26816B', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#FFFFFF' }}>4</Text></Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 58, height: 60, background: '#26816B', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#FFFFFF' }}>5</Text></Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 58, height: 60, background: '#CB6B28', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#FFFFFF' }}>6</Text></Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 58, height: 60, background: '#CB6B28', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#FFFFFF' }}>7</Text></Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 58, height: 60, background: '#CB6B28', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#FFFFFF' }}>8</Text></Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 58, height: 60, background: '#CB6B28', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#FFFFFF' }}>9</Text></Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 58, height: 60, background: '#CB6B28', borderRadius: 6, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#FFFFFF' }}>10</Text></Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', height: 110, gap: 20 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 325, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 10, padding: '14px 20px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>50%</Text>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>至少一次成功</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>重复两次后仍是 50%</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ width: 325, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 10, padding: '14px 20px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>50%</Text>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>两次全部成功</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>重复两次后仍是 50%</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16, height: 100, background: '#FFF4E6', borderRadius: 10, padding: '0 20px' }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 62, background: '#CB6B28' }} />
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#CB6B28' }}>不是 75% 与 25%</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>题目难度不同，不能当作同一枚硬币；必须先逐题计算，再按规定汇总。</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 450, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 16 }}>

            <Box style={{ height: 200, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 10, padding: '16px 20px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>样本内估计（1 ≤ k ≤ n）</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#20344B', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>每题采样 n 次，观察到 c 次成功</Text>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1 }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>pass@k　1 − C(n−c, k) / C(n, k){'\n'}pass^k　C(c, k) / C(n, k)</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ height: 200, background: '#F4F7FA', borderRadius: 10, padding: '16px 20px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>两个前提</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>C(a, k) 表示从 a 项中选 k 项的组合数，a 小于 k 时取 0。</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>这些是独立同分布采样条件下的无偏估计；k 大于 1 时，把有限样本的 c / n 直接代入幂公式，一般并不无偏。</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ height: 100, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 10, padding: '16px 20px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>比较成绩时，同时对齐四件事</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779' }}>尝试次数　·　验证方式　·　环境重置　·　预算</Text>
            </Box>

        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>1.3 怎样把“聪明”变成可测量的问题</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>18 / 31</Text>
    </Box>

</Slide>
